      "content": "i feel like i'm just ruining everything. my family... they've spent generations building this perfect name, this perfect history, and then there's me. i'm just a crack in the foundation. i look at them and i just feel like a stain on everything they've worked for. i hate that i'm the one who's breaking the line.",
